  <section class="hero">
    <h1>About Whispers</h1>
    <p>Whispers is a privacy-first file storage experience that keeps your files encrypted before they leave your browser.</p>
  </section>

  <section class="panel">
    <h2>How the product works</h2>
    <p>Your browser generates and retains the decryption key locally. The server stores only encrypted data and metadata, and decryption happens in the browser when you choose to download a file.</p>
  </section>

  <section class="panel">
    <h2>Prompt summary</h2>
    <p>The site was created around a simple goal: provide anonymous, secure, browser-based file storage without requiring user accounts. The experience emphasizes local key control, encrypted uploads, collection-based organization, and clear user guidance.</p>
  </section>
</div>
